<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equated to FOB Omaha Basis as of 3:00 PM and compared to Friday's 3:00 PM close: Fresh loins were steady to 2.00 lower; butts generally 2.00 lower; skinned hams 1.00 higher; seedless bellies steady to 1.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to 1.00 lower. Trading was slow to moderate, with light demand and mostly heavy retail offerings, with light to moderate processing offerings. -- USDA</p>
